    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Duck Amikaze Strikes Back, is a retro style, challenging 2D precision platformer, with a touch of satirical humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earning medals isn\u2019t required to finish the game\u2026 And if you prefer, you can hide the timer in the accessibility options\u2026 but GOLD medals are the only way to become THE DUCK LEGEND!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show mother nature who is the <strong>real apex predator!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/548371eccfe1a44886d7e8a72a133112.poster.avif?t=1750409879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/548371eccfe1a44886d7e8a72a133112.webm?t=1750409879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/548371eccfe1a44886d7e8a72a133112.mp4?t=1750409879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like in the story of <strong>David and Goliath</strong>, be cunning like a... Duck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/f205813e18ca289b63fa87859cd4530a.poster.avif?t=1750409879\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/f205813e18ca289b63fa87859cd4530a.webm?t=1750409879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/f205813e18ca289b63fa87859cd4530a.mp4?t=1750409879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Duck Amikaze, just as the mighty <strong>Phoenix</strong> rises from the ashes, will always Strikes Back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/d003b4f8dcdd14854fd89daa3eacabf0.poster.avif?t=1750409879\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/d003b4f8dcdd14854fd89daa3eacabf0.webm?t=1750409879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/d003b4f8dcdd14854fd89daa3eacabf0.mp4?t=1750409879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through <strong>5 different regions</strong>, and hunt to ashes all the hunters nearby your duck nest to avenge your family, eaten by those... humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware the wildlife of those regions\u2026 savage animals might try to eat some of your <strong>crispy duck tenders</strong> as you charge headlong into each hunter\u2019s hut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to collect the 4 vegetables in each level of the game, sometimes well hidden behind <strong>secret walls</strong>. But beware of the traps set by the hunter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/13e20d2c41d2256cddeb74a8267918ee.poster.avif?t=1750409879\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/13e20d2c41d2256cddeb74a8267918ee.webm?t=1750409879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/13e20d2c41d2256cddeb74a8267918ee.mp4?t=1750409879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessibility:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select <strong>Easy Mode</strong> in the option menu to have 5 hearts and infinite jumps if you struggle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you prefer you can hide the three User Interface element separately : hearts, collectible, timer, from the option menu.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you beat the game in either easy or normal mode, you'll unlock <strong>Hardcore Mode</strong>, where just one hit turns you into... crispy duck tenders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove yourself worthy by earning all the golden duck medals, to become THE Duck Legend!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Duck Amikaze Strikes Back, is a retro style, challenging 2D precision platformer, with a touch of satirical humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earning medals isn\u2019t required to finish the game\u2026 And if you prefer, you can hide the timer in the accessibility options\u2026 but GOLD medals are the only way to become THE DUCK LEGEND!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show mother nature who is the <strong>real apex predator!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/548371eccfe1a44886d7e8a72a133112.poster.avif?t=1750409879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/548371eccfe1a44886d7e8a72a133112.webm?t=1750409879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/548371eccfe1a44886d7e8a72a133112.mp4?t=1750409879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like in the story of <strong>David and Goliath</strong>, be cunning like a... Duck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/f205813e18ca289b63fa87859cd4530a.poster.avif?t=1750409879\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/f205813e18ca289b63fa87859cd4530a.webm?t=1750409879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/f205813e18ca289b63fa87859cd4530a.mp4?t=1750409879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Duck Amikaze, just as the mighty <strong>Phoenix</strong> rises from the ashes, will always Strikes Back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/d003b4f8dcdd14854fd89daa3eacabf0.poster.avif?t=1750409879\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/d003b4f8dcdd14854fd89daa3eacabf0.webm?t=1750409879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/d003b4f8dcdd14854fd89daa3eacabf0.mp4?t=1750409879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through <strong>5 different regions</strong>, and hunt to ashes all the hunters nearby your duck nest to avenge your family, eaten by those... humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware the wildlife of those regions\u2026 savage animals might try to eat some of your <strong>crispy duck tenders</strong> as you charge headlong into each hunter\u2019s hut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to collect the 4 vegetables in each level of the game, sometimes well hidden behind <strong>secret walls</strong>. But beware of the traps set by the hunter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/13e20d2c41d2256cddeb74a8267918ee.poster.avif?t=1750409879\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/13e20d2c41d2256cddeb74a8267918ee.webm?t=1750409879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413520/extras/13e20d2c41d2256cddeb74a8267918ee.mp4?t=1750409879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessibility:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select <strong>Easy Mode</strong> in the option menu to have 5 hearts and infinite jumps if you struggle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you prefer you can hide the three User Interface element separately : hearts, collectible, timer, from the option menu.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you beat the game in either easy or normal mode, you'll unlock <strong>Hardcore Mode</strong>, where just one hit turns you into... crispy duck tenders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove yourself worthy by earning all the golden duck medals, to become THE Duck Legend!</p>",
    "short_description": "Help Amikaze get his revenge! Run, jump, dodge, bounce and make your way as fast as you can to blast the local hunters! Revenge your family who ended up as tenders! And beat the gold times to become THE legendary duck!",
